msgstr "Prérequis"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:142
msgid ""
"A shared storage LUN is provisioned and accessible to all cluster hosts "
"via iSCSI or Fibre Channel"
msgstr "Un LUN de stockage partagé est provisionné et accessible à tous les hôtes du cluster via iSCSI ou Fibre Channel"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:143
msgid ""
"The iSCSI target for the LUN has been added to the cluster (see `Adding "
"iSCSI Targets`_ below)"
msgstr "La cible iSCSI du LUN a été ajoutée au cluster (voir `Adding iSCSI Targets`_ ci-dessous)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/storage_operations.rst:144
msgid "All hosts can see the block device (verify with ``lsblk`` on each host)"
msgstr "Tous les hôtes voient le périphérique bloc (vérifiez avec ``lsblk`` sur chaque hôte)"

